        "id": 178911,
        "name": "Melkhor",
        "username": "Melkhor",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-07-26T17:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>By God... I FINALLY got it. The Operative fell at last after Mr. Fixer's incapacitated power allowed Expatriette to shotgun his former student straight to hell (or rather, straight to Zhu Long's temple, I should say)!</p><p>Expatriette at 1, Fixer down for the count and Nightmist at 4.</p><p>After that harrowing ordeal, I don't want to see either the Chairman or Rook City again for a VERY long time!</p>",
